  m_text: "Mutual funds are a practical, cost-efficient way to build a diversified
    portfolio of stocks, bonds, or short-term investments. With more than 70 years
    in the business, Fidelity offers the tools and experience to help you build an
    investment strategy that matches your investing style.\r\n\LDedicated to innovation
